  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Global Credit Program for Mortgage Market Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Primer Programa Global de Crdito para el Desarrollo de Mercados Hipotecarios</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la Lnea y de su Primer Programa es promover el desarrollo eficiente e inclusivo de los mercados hipotecarios primario y secundario de Mxico. Su propsito es proporcionar instrumentos que mejoren la estructura de pasivos del balance de SHF para que pueda continuar desempeando su papel contracclico de fuente de liquidez y de desarrollo eficiente de los mercados primario y secundario, ampliando el acceso de segmentos desatendidos a la financiacin de vivienda.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general goal of the Line and this, its First Program, is to promote the efficient and inclusive development of housing finance markets in Mxico. Its purpose is to provide SHF with tools to strengthen the structure of its liabilities so as to permit it to continue countering the downturn in financial markets as a source of liquidity, fostering the efficient development of primary and secondary markets and expanding access to housing finance to populations previously unserved or underserved.</narrative>
  </description>
